  "source": "# The dormitory\n\nKydux's own art, made for the game and under the GNU GPL, version 3 or\nlater, like the rest of it.\n\n- Painted by Gemini 3 Pro Image (`gemini-3-pro-image`) from\n  `tools/art/prompts/image-first-dormitory-3.md`, with the field as its\n  style's reference; its border and the wands on its trunks edited by it\n  (`game-dormitory-border.md`), its grid removed (`game-dormitory-nogrid.md`).\n- Its corridor's right end mended by Gemini, joined by `tools/art/repaint.py`,\n  the painting kept pixel for pixel elsewhere: the castle's wall closing the\n  corridor off from the battlements, going on from the rooms' front wall\n  (`game-dormitory-corner-2.md`).\n- Its door to the corridor opened without a model (`repaint.py doorways`),\n  its leaf painted with the common room's own floor.\n- Its beds, trunks, bedside tables, armchairs and table, and the beds' quilts\n  and sheets, cut where Gemini painted them flat magenta in pictures of the\n  dormitory (`game-dormitory-marked-*.md`, `game-dormitory-covers-*.md`); its\n  walls by polygons, each edge on its outline.\n- Its cells marked by hand and exported by `tools/art/export_scene.py`.\n",
